            "review_title": "Review at The Pencil Café",
            "review_text": "Ngoc\n12 contributions\n0\nCozy little cafe, best coffee in Hanoi\nJul 2024 • Friends\nI had a really nice experience. Staffs are lovely, the coffee is great and love the relaxing atmosphere. This is a lovely little haven for anyone who appreciates great coffee and warm service. Highly recommend that you seek out this place if you are in the old Quarter of Hanoi.\nWritten July 3, 2024",
